---
import "../styles/home.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="description" content="Dharitree Bezboruah — research scholar, physicist, and curious human." />
<title>Dharitree Bezboruah</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://banglawebfonts.pages.dev/css/kalpurush.css" />
<script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/2d462008c1.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</head>

<style is:global>
/* Keep the landing-page header visible while scrolling */
.site-header {
  position: fixed !important;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  z-index: 1000;
  padding: 32px 5vw;
  background: #093a41;
}

.site-header nav {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 30px;
}

.site-header nav a {
  color: #dfdccb;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 400;
  position: relative;
}

.site-header nav .home-icon {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.site-header nav .home-icon svg {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  fill: currentColor;
}

.site-header nav .home-icon::after {
  display: none;
}

.site-header nav .home-icon:hover {
  opacity: 0.65;
}

.site-header nav a:not(.home-icon)::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  bottom: -5px;
  width: 0;
  height: 1px;
  background: #ff004f;
  transition: width 0.3s ease;
}

.site-header nav a:not(.home-icon):hover::after {
  width: 100%;
}

/* Prevent the fixed header from covering the top of the hero */
.hero {
  padding-top: 110px;
}

@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .site-header {
    padding: 25px;
  }

  .site-header nav {
    gap: 15px;
  }

  .hero {
    padding-top: 90px;
  }
}
</style>

<body>
<section class="hero">
<header class="site-header">
<a href="/website/" class="site-name">Dharitree Bezboruah</a>
<nav>
<a href="/website/" class="home-icon" aria-label="Home" title="Home">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M3 10.5 12 3l9 7.5v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5.5v-6h-5v6H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-9Z" />
</svg>
</a>
<a href="/website/about/">About</a>
<a href="/website/blog/">Blog</a>
<a href="/website/gallery/">Gallery</a>
</nav>
</header>
<div class="hero-title-group">
<div class="hero-kicker">La Vie<br />Est Belle</div>
<div class="hero-subtitle">Life is beautiful</div>
</div>
<a href="#about" class="scroll-cue" aria-label="Scroll down"><span></span><small>scroll</small></a>
</section>
<section id="about" class="about-section">
<div class="about-inner">
<div class="about-image"><img src="/website/images/my_img.jpeg" alt="Dharitree Bezboruah" /></div>
<div class="about-text">
<div id="english-content" class="language-content english-content">
<p class="eyebrow">A little about me</p>
<h2>Dharitree Bezboruah</h2>
<p>Hi, I'm Dharitree Bezboruah, a research scholar in the Department of Physics at Tezpur University, Assam. My research focuses on astroparticle physics, and I am currently working under the supervision of Dr. Moon Moon Devi.</p>
<p>If you'd like to know more about my academic background, you can download my <a href="/website/CV_DBB.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CV</a>.</p>
<p>Curious about my research? Feel free to explore my work on <a href="https://inspirehep.net/literature?sort=mostrecent&size=25&page=1&q=Dharitree%20Bezboruah" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">iNSPIRE-HEP</a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="assamese-content" class="language-content assamese-content" hidden>
<p class="eyebrow">মোৰ বিষয়ে অলপ</p>
<h2>ধৰিত্ৰী বেজৱৰুৱা</h2>
<p>মই ধৰিত্ৰী। তেজপুৰ বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়ৰ পদাৰ্থবিজ্ঞান বিভাগৰ এগৰাকী গৱেষণা ছাত্ৰী। মই বৰ্তমান ড° মুনমুন দেৱীৰ তত্বাৱধানত জ্যোতিপদাৰ্থবিজ্ঞান আৰু নিউট্ৰিনো নামৰ মৌলিক কণাবোৰৰ বিষয়ে গৱেষণাৰত।</p>
<p>আপোনালোকে মোৰ গৱেষণাৰ বিৱৰণৰ বাবে আগ্ৰহী হ’লে মোৰ <a href="https://inspirehep.net/literature?sort=mostrecent&size=25&page=1&q=Dharitree%20Bezboruah" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">iNSPIRE-HEP</a> একাউণ্টটো চাব পাৰে।</p>
<p>মোৰ শৈক্ষিক পটভূমিৰ বিষয়ে অধিক জানিবলৈ মোৰ <a href="/website/CV_DBB.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CV</a> ডাউনলোড কৰিব পাৰে।</p>
</div>
<button id="language-toggle" class="language-toggle" type="button" aria-controls="english-content assamese-content" aria-label="Show Assamese">অসমীয়া</button>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<footer>
<div class="socials">
<a href="https://www.facebook.com/dharitree.bezboruah/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook"><i class="fab fa-facebook"></i></a>
<a href="https://www.instagram.com/dharitreebezboruah/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
<a href="https://x.com/Dbezsky911/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="X"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dharitree-bezboruah-b24027205/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn"><i class="fab fa-linkedin"></i></a>
</div>
<p>© Dharitree Bezboruah</p>
</footer>
<script>
const languageToggle = document.getElementById("language-toggle");
const englishContent = document.getElementById("english-content");
const assameseContent = document.getElementById("assamese-content");
languageToggle.addEventListener("click", () => {
const showingEnglish = !englishContent.hidden;
englishContent.hidden = showingEnglish;
assameseContent.hidden = !showingEnglish;
languageToggle.textContent = showingEnglish ? "English" : "অসমীয়া";
languageToggle.setAttribute("aria-label", showingEnglish ? "Show English" : "Show Assamese");
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
